  "bodyHash": "b66f4b1b6b66faca",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。針對 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 有大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Natural Charcoal 讓野火變得有用！當原木被火焰摧毀時，有機率掉落木炭。木炭對火焰免疫，因此不會被附近的火焰摧毀。預設生成機率為 2/3，但這可以在設定檔中更改。<br><br>您也可以將原木放在營火旁邊來將其轉化為木炭。這比使用熔爐稍快一些：30 秒內可產出四塊，而熔煉則需要 40 秒。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>charcoalIsImmuneToFire</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">木炭物品在掉落到火中時是否應存活。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>burnedLogBecomesCharcoalChance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.67，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">被燒毀的原木方塊轉化為木炭的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>charcoalDropAmount</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1，最小值 1，最大值 64</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">從被燒毀的原木中應掉落多少木炭。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>火焰穿過該區域！非常實用，因為它會產生木炭 :)</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/natural-charcoal/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>每次原木被火焰摧毀時，都有機率掉落木炭：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/natural-charcoal/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>也可以透過營火來製作木炭：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/natural-charcoal/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">已停用評論功能，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
